# DO NOT put your real key in this file. This file (.env.example) is
# committed to git — anything you write here is public. Instead:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# ...then open .env (not this file) and paste your real key there. .env is
# gitignored and stays local to your machine.
#
# Same OpenAI account you already use for ChatGPT — but API usage is billed
# separately from any ChatGPT subscription. Add a payment method under
# API billing specifically at platform.openai.com/settings/organization/billing
# before running scripts/tts.ts, or TTS calls will fail with a billing error.
OPENAI_API_KEY=REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_OWN_KEY_IN_DOT_ENV_NOT_HERE
